  "fullDescription": "Go back to the future with the Buhun font, a retro-inspired trio collection that brings vintage cool to the modern age.\n\nThis Buhun typeface captures the funky, groovy energy of the 70s with its thick, pillowy “bubble” letterforms and classic drop shadows. Whether you are designing for a retro-themed café, streetwear apparel, or a music festival poster, the Buhun font provides an instant blast of nostalgia and style.\n\nThe Buhun typeface is incredibly versatile, often coming as part of a set that includes bubble, serif, and script variants to help you build a cohesive visual identity. Use the bubble version for high-impact headlines and the script version for subheadings to create a dynamic, layered look. Pair it with warm, “sunset” color palettes (oranges, creams, and browns) to maximize its vintage appeal. It’s the perfect choice for brands that want to feel timeless yet incredibly trendy.\n\nWith thick shapes, groovy characters, and a strong vintage vibe, Buhun Retro Display is perfect for:\n– Retro Posters & Branding\n– Merchandise Design\n– Nostalgic Logo & Packaging\n– Social Media Content\n– Magazine Headlines & Labels\n– 70s–80s Themed Projects\n\nMake your visual work unforgettable with Buhun Retro Display – Bubble, Serif, Script!\nOne pack, three styles, endless creative ideas!",
